enka","description":"President of the Republic of Belarus","enwiki":"Alexander Lukashenko","summary":"Alexander Grigoryevich Lukashenko (also transliterated from Belarusian as Alyaksandr Ryhoravich Lukashenka; born 30 August 1954) is a Belarusian politician who has been the first and only president of Belarus since the office's establishment in 1994, making him the current longest-tenured European president.\nLukashenko was born in Kopys. After graduating from what is now the Mogilev State A. Kuleshov University, he worked as the director of a state farm (sovkhoz) and served in both the Soviet Border Troops and the Soviet Army before embarking on his political career. In 1990, Lukashenko was elected to the Supreme Soviet of the Byelorussian Soviet Socialist Republic.","image":"Александр Лукашенко (13-04-2023) (cropped).jpg","birth":1954.6602739726027,"death":null},"Q56235580":{"label":"Alexander Turchyn","description":"Prime Minister of the Republic of Belarus","enwiki":"Alexander Turchin","summary":"Alexander Genrikhovich Turchin (Russian: Алексaндр Гeнрихович Турчин, Belarusian: Аляксaндaр Гeнрыхавіч Турчын, romanized: Alaksandar Hienrychavič Turčyn; born 2 July 1975) is a Belarusian politician serving as the 11th Prime Minister of Belarus since 10 March 2025. He was previously the chairman of the executive committee of Minsk Region from 3 December 2019 and was the first deputy prime minister of Belarus from 2018 to 2019.","image":"Aliaksandr Turčyn.png","birth":1975.4986301369863,"death":null}},"media":{"Flag of Belarus.svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/85/Flag_of_Belarus.svg/330px-Flag_of_Belarus.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Belarus.svg","author":"See File history below for details.","license":"Public domain"},"Coat of arms of Belarus (2020–present).svg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Coat_of_arms_of_Belarus_%282020%E2%80%93present%29.svg/330px-Coat_of_arms_of_Belarus_%282020%E2%80%93present%29.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coat_of_arms_of_Belarus_(2020%E2%80%93present).svg","author":"Кот Баюн, Добромир Костадинов","license":"Public domain"},"Александр Лукашенко (13-04-2023) (cropped).jpg":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fe/%D0%90%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D1%80_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BA%D0%BE_%2813-04-2023%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-%D0%90%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D1%80_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BA%D0%BE_%2813-04-2023%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%90%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B4%D1%80_%D0%9B%D1%83%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BA%D0%BE_(13-04-2023)_(cropped).jpg","author":"Пресс-служба Раиса Республики Татарстан","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"Aliaksandr Turčyn.png":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/52/Aliaksandr_Tur%C4%8Dyn.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Aliaksandr_Tur%C4%8Dyn.png","author":"Белорусское телеграфное агентство (БелТА)","license":"CC BY 3.0"}},"names":["(نام دیگر و معروف، ولی نادرست:) روسیه سفید","Belarus","Belarus (Byelorussia)","Belarús","Belorussia","Belorussland","Belorußland","Beyaz Rusya","Biała Ruś","Białoruś","Bielorrusia","Bielorrússia","Bielorussia","Biélor.","Biélorussie","Byeloruss","Byelorussia","Bélarus","Republic of Belarus","Republiek Belarus","Republik Belarus","Republika Białorusi","República da Bielorrússia","República de Belarús","Ruthenia Alba","Weißrussland","Weißruthenien","White Russia","White Ruthenia","Wit-Rusland","by","la République de B